{
  "_note": "Hand-built Phase-1 seed graph: 8 processes across 8 APQC domains (Core Model \u00a713 step 4 \u2014 widen before UI). Includes deliberate variety for the harness: a financial-threshold escalate_if (FN/SC), a task-level guardrail override stricter than its process (IT.8.4.2.t3), an orphaned KPI (kpi.unused_metric), and a process with no strategic parent (HR.7.2.5 via kpi.applicant_pass_rate). CO.3.2.7.t3 + gr.CO.3.2.7 v3 reproduce the \u00a703 worked example verbatim.",
